OL,3,ABadenoch presses Burnham on borrowing
OL,4,Acosts at his first Prime Minister's
OL,5,AQuestions
OL,6,
OL,7,FKemi Badenoch has pressed Andy Burnham
OL,8,Fon how much the UK pays to borrow money
OL,9,Fat his first Prime Minister's Questions
OL,10,Fsince taking office
OL,12,FAsked how he plans to tackle rising
OL,13,Fdebt costs, Burnham blames the
OL,14,F"turbulence on global markets" on the
OL,15,Fprevious Tory government - and says "we
OL,16,Fare turning that corner"
OL,18,FBadenoch says the markets are worried
OL,19,Fabout a PM who "wants to say yes to
OL,20,Feveryone" and asks if he plans to raise
OL,21,Ftaxes; Burnham says his first moves
OL,22,Fwere to "cut tax"
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/38
